      "book.ice_and_fire_delight.category.foods.mini_pizza.page4.text": "在我们的面团准备就绪后，千万别忘了先挤一些番茄酱在上面。随后再加入熟鸡块。",
      "effect.ice_and_fire_delight.poison_resistance.description": "对“中毒”效果免疫",
      "effect.ice_and_fire_delight.lightning_strike": "雷霆之力",
      "book.ice_and_fire_delight.category.foods.ectoplasm_jelly.name": "魂质果冻",
      "book.ice_and_fire_delight.category.foods.ectoplasm_jelly.page2.text": "这个果冻需要厨锅来制作。你所需要的只有两个魂质。把它们扔进去，耐心等待，一个魂质果冻新鲜出炉！",
      "book.ice_and_fire_delight.category.foods.mini_pizza.page3.title": "配方",
      "effect.ice_and_fire_delight.ice_aspect.description": "在攻击时冻结敌人",
      "book.ice_and_fire_delight.category.drinks.lightning_lily_extract.page2.text": "闪电百合提取液需要通过厨锅制备。我们需要2个闪电百合，把它们放进厨锅煮沸搅拌5秒，准备就绪后把提取液倒进空试管即可。",
      "item.ice_and_fire_delight.tooltip.myrmex_jungle_resin_jelly.line1": "§2丛林",
