      "advancements.feel_spicy.descr": "品尝用闪光鳞片制作的风味薯片！",
      "item.ice_and_fire_delight.fried_dragon_egg": "煎龙蛋",
      "book.ice_and_fire_delight.category.drinks.lightning_lily_extract.page2.title": "配方",
      "item.ice_and_fire_delight.tooltip.dragon_special_sausage.line2": "§9龙之力 (15:00)",
      "item.ice_and_fire_delight.tooltip.dragon_special_sausage.line1": "§9龙之翼 (20:00)",
      "book.ice_and_fire_delight.category.foods.myrmex_desert_resin_jelly.page2.text": "你可能已经从名字就猜到了，这道菜是用沙漠蚁脂制作而成的。你只需要把两块沙漠蚁脂扔进厨锅里即可。",
      "item.ice_and_fire_delight.ice_heart_with_potatoes_in_mushroom_sauce": "冰心土豆蘑菇酱",
      "item.ice_and_fire_delight.cooked_sea_serpent_slice": "熟海蟒肉片",
      "item.ice_and_fire_delight.fire_dragon_ramen": "火龙拉面",
      "book.ice_and_fire_delight.category.foods.myrmex_desert_resin_jelly.page2.title": "配方",
      "advancements.grant_book_on_first_join_adv.title": "Technical adv",
      "item.ice_and_fire_delight.tooltip.honey_glazed_cyclops_eye.line1": "",
      "effect.ice_and_fire_delight.warming.description": "免疫“冰霜附加”的效果",
      "item.ice_and_fire_delight.mini_pizza_blank": "迷你披萨面团",
      "item.ice_and_fire_delight.silver_knife": "银色小刀",
      "item.ice_and_fire_delight.fiery_hot_pie_slice": "火热派切块",
      "jei.ice_and_fire_delight.knife": "小刀是轻量的近战武器。你可以用它们从草类植物中获得草秆，也可以击杀动物以获得副掉落物。",
      "book.ice_and_fire_delight.category.foods.ectoplasm_jelly.desc": "魂质果冻十分罕见，事实上想要制作它甚至会比制作一碗海蟒鲜汤或者蜜汁食人妖肉拌饭困难。什么？你问为什么？因为至少还存在着一些策略技巧可以对付食人妖和海蟒，但是面对幽灵时，你几乎无计可施。",
      "advancements.cafeteria_pizza_adv.title": "自助披萨",
      "book.ice_and_fire_delight.category.foods.fresh_soup_from_sea_serpent.name": "海蟒鲜汤",
      "book.ice_and_fire_delight.category.foods.fresh_soup_from_sea_serpent.desc": "这个菜肴是由一种强大的海洋怪物制作而来的。很少有人有机会品尝，因为鲜有人能够击败那个怪物。",
      "book.ice_and_fire_delight.category.foods.troll_meat.page2.title": "配方",
      "book.ice_and_fire_delight.category.items.dragonsteel_ice_knife.desc": "龙霜钢小刀是一款精致耐用的厨房工具，可保持低温，是处理精致食材的理想之选。其闪亮的刀刃使其即使切硬食物也能轻松保持锋利。这把刀不仅实用，还能成为任何厨房的点缀。",
      "book.ice_and_fire_delight.category.drinks.fire_lily_extract.page2.title": "配方",
      "block.ice_and_fire_delight.fiery_hot_pie": "§b火热派",
      "book.ice_and_fire_delight.category.foods.eye_chowder.page2.text": "要烹制这道菜，您需要将以下食材放入锅中：洋葱、土豆、骨头以及使这道菜如此命名的最重要的食材——巨人独眼。",
      "item.ice_and_fire_delight.cool_sandwich": "清爽三明治",
      "book.ice_and_fire_delight.category.drinks.lightning_lily_extract.desc": "闪电百合提取液是从闪电百合中提取出的浓缩物质。你可以用它调味亦或是直接饮用。当你喝下去时你会得到25秒的“雷霆之力”效果。",
      "book.ice_and_fire_delight.category.drinks.lightning_lily_extract.name": "闪电百合提取液",
      "book.ice_and_fire_delight.category.foods.mini_pizza.page3.text": "之后我们要将面团放进熔炉里加热一会，加热的时间根据熔炉的种类而定。",
      "item.ice_and_fire_delight.dragonsteel_fire_knife": "龙炎钢小刀",
      "item.ice_and_fire_delight.honey_glazed_cyclops_eye": "Honey glazed Cyclops eye",
      "item.ice_and_fire_delight.chips_from_shiny_scales": "闪光鳞片薯片",
      "book.ice_and_fire_delight.category.foods.name": "食物",
